/JS (\057\057 Nome do campo que cont\351m a porcentagem\015\012var campoPercentual \075 this\056getField\050\042fill\1372\1374\042\051\056value\073\015\012\015\012\057\057 Remove o s\355mbolo \045 \050caso exista\051 e converte em n\372mero\015\012var valor \075 parseFloat\050campoPercentual\051\073\015\012\015\012\057\057 Se o valor n\343o for v\341lido \050vazio\054 NaN etc\056\051\054 deixa o campo em branco\015\012if \050isNaN\050valor\051\051 \173event\056value\075\042\042\073\175 else if\050valor\07450\051\173event\056value\075\042ALTO\042\073if\050typeof campo\041\075\075\042undefined\042\051campo\056strokeColor\075color\056red\073\175 else if\050valor\074\07575\051\173event\056value\075\042M\311DIO\042\073if\050typeof campo\041\075\075\042undefined\042\051campo\056strokeColor\075color\056yellow\073\175 else \173event\056value\075\042BAIXO\042\073if\050typeof campo\041\075\075\042undefined\042\051campo\056strokeColor\075color\056green\073\175\012\012if\050bpfPdfPCCFailUnit\056call\050this\0548\0540\051\051 \173event\056value\075\042ALTO \055 PCC\042\073try\173this\056getField\050\042Dropdown41\042\051\056strokeColor\075color\056red\073\175catch\050ignore\051\173\175\175\012)
/S /JavaScript
>>
endobj
