/JS (\057\057 Obt\351m o valor selecionado no dropdown\015\012var valor \075 this\056getField\050\042Dropdown41\042\051\056value\073 \057\057 altere \042nivel\042 se o campo tiver outro nome\015\012\015\012\057\057 Obt\351m o checkbox \050Group\051 que deve mudar de cor\015\012var campo \075 this\056getField\050\042Group241\042\051\073\015\012\015\012\057\057 Verifica se o campo existe antes de aplicar as cores\015\012if \050campo\051 \173\015\012    switch \050valor\051 \173\015\012        case \042ALTO\042\072\015\012            campo\056fillColor \075 color\056red\073 \057\057 fundo vermelho\015\012    campo\056strokeColor \075 color\056red\073\015\012            break\073\015\012        case \042M\311DIO\042\072\015\012            campo\056fillColor \075 color\056yellow\073 \057\057 fundo amarelo\015\012    campo\056strokeColor \075 color\056yellow\073\015\012            break\073\015\012        case \042BAIXO\042\072\015\012            campo\056fillColor \075 color\056green\073 \057\057 fundo verde\015\012   campo\056strokeColor \075 color\056green\073\015\012            break\073\015\012        default\072\015\012            campo\056fillColor \075 color\056white\073 \057\057 padr\343o\015\012    \175\015\012\175\012\012if\050bpfPdfPCCFailUnit\056call\050this\0548\0540\051\051 \173event\056value\075\042ALTO \055 PCC\042\073try\173this\056getField\050\042Dropdown41\042\051\056strokeColor\075color\056red\073\175catch\050ignore\051\173\175\175\012)
/S /JavaScript
>>
endobj
