/JS (\057\057 Nome do checkbox que controla a condi\347\343o\015\012var controle \075 this\056getField\050\042Group200\042\051\073 \057\057 substitua pelo nome real do checkbox de controle\015\012\015\012\057\057 Dropdown com os n\355veis\015\012var nivel \075 this\056getField\050\042Dropdown56\042\051\073 \057\057 substitua \042nivel\042 pelo nome do seu campo dropdown\015\012\015\012\057\057 Obt\351m o checkbox \050Group\051 que deve mudar de cor\015\012var campo \075 this\056getField\050\042Group253\042\051\073\015\012\015\012\057\057 Refer\352ncia ao checkbox que mudar\341 de cor\015\012\057\057 var campo \075 event\056target\073\015\012\015\012\057\057 Verifica se o checkbox de controle est\341 marcado\015\012if \050controle\056value \075\075\075 \0420\042\051 \173\015\012\015\012    \057\057 Se estiver marcado\054 muda a cor conforme o dropdown\015\012    switch \050nivel\056value\051 \173\015\012        case \042ALTO\042\072\015\012            campo\056fillColor \075 color\056red\073 \057\057 vermelho\015\012            campo\056strokeColor \075 color\056red\073\015\012            break\073\015\012        case \042M\311DIO\042\072\015\012            campo\056fillColor \075 color\056yellow\073 \057\057 amarelo\015\012            campo\056strokeColor \075 color\056yellow\073\015\012            break\073\015\012        case \042BAIXO\042\072\015\012            campo\056fillColor \075 color\056green\073 \057\057 verde\015\012            campo\056strokeColor \075 color\056green\073\015\012            break\073\015\012        default\072\015\012            campo\056fillColor \075 color\056white\073 \057\057 padr\343o se o dropdown estiver vazio\015\012    \175\015\012\015\012\175 else \173\015\012    \057\057 Se o checkbox de controle N\303O estiver marcado\054 n\343o muda nada\015\012    \057\057 \050ou\054 se quiser for\347ar a cor branca\054 descomente a linha abaixo\051\015\012    campo\056fillColor \075 color\056white\073\015\012\175\015\012)
/S /JavaScript
>>
endobj
